上一位穿它的精灵  就这么说吧
who had the tights they gave me, well, let's just say

334
00:13:41,720 --> 00:13:44,220
她的精灵大姨妈突然来访
her little lady elf friend visited unexpectedly.

335
00:13:46,420 --> 00:13:47,920
还真有其他时期[经期]的衣服呢
Talk about a period costume.

336
00:13:49,280 --> 00:13:50,640
是啊  超恶心啊
You're right. It's disgusting.

337
00:13:51,540 --> 00:13:52,900
我做不来
I can't do this anymore.

338
00:13:53,420 --> 00:13:55,320
我要走了  我不想扮精灵了
I'm leaving. I don't want to do this anymore.

339
00:13:55,540 --> 00:13:58,040
我身心疲惫同时又焦躁不堪
I feel tired and wired at the same time.

340
00:13:58,080 --> 00:14:00,920
这个主意好糟糕  好糟糕  好糟糕  好糟糕
This was an awful, awful, awful, awful, awful idea!

341
00:14:01,040 --> 00:14:02,080
够了  冷静
All right, calm down!

342
00:14:02,380 --> 00:14:04,140
老天  你就像只圣诞抽风猴子
Jeez, you're like a Christmas crack monkey.

343
00:14:05,360 --> 00:14:07,340
听着  我们哪也不去  知道吗
Look, we are not going anywhere, okay?

344
00:14:08,180 --> 00:14:10,540
我衣服都穿好了  我们需要这份工作
You got me all elfed up, and now we need these jobs.

345
00:14:10,540 --> 00:14:11,860
所以去找个人说说
So just go talk to someone

346
00:14:11,860 --> 00:14:13,720
解释下你得换身新衣服的原因
and tell them why you need a new pair of tights.

347
00:14:13,920 --> 00:14:15,580
我做不到  太尴尬了
I can't. It's embarrassing.

348
00:14:15,900 --> 00:14:18,780
要么你去问她  要么你把裤裆撕开
Look, either you ask her, or you rip out the crotch

349
00:14:18,984 --> 00:14:21,000
或冒着露出冬日"阴"境给小朋友的风险
and risk showing six-year-olds your winter wonderland.

350
00:14:22,760 --> 00:14:23,840
我伤心了
Now I'm sad.

351
00:14:24,860 --> 00:14:26,200
你  深色头发的那个
You, the one with the dark hair,

352
00:14:26,240 --> 00:14:27,680
-你跟我来一下  -去哪儿
- I need you to come with me. - Where?

353
00:14:27,800 --> 00:14:29,080
不会是去做药检吧
And is there a drug test involved?

354
00:14:30,060 --> 00:14:32,760
计划有变  我要你扮演圣诞老奶奶
Change of plans. I need for you to be Mrs. Claus.

355
00:14:33,060 --> 00:14:35,420
原来那个人拿更年期当借口跑了
The other one had to leave-- blamed menopause.

356
00:14:36,340 --> 00:14:37,140
拜托  更年期算什么
Menopause, please.

357
00:14:37,780 --> 00:14:40,520
我午饭时间去把子宫切掉
I had my uterus yanked out on my lunch hour,

358
00:14:40,520 --> 00:14:41,820
下午两点照样准时上班
and I was back at my desk by 2:00.

359
00:14:45,180 --> 00:14:45,600
跟我来
Follow me...

360
00:14:46,080 --> 00:14:48,760
除非你不想每个小时多挣两块钱
Unless, uh, you don't want that extra $2 an hour.

361
00:14:49,400 --> 00:14:51,600
不行  精灵果汁把我搞成这样
Oh, no. You are not leaving me here alone

362
00:14:51,600 --> 00:14:53,120
你不能在这时候抛下我
when I'm crashing on elf juice.

363
00:14:53,420 --> 00:14:54,680
如果我不能扮演旧时的歌手
If I can't be an old-timey singer,

364
00:14:54,720 --> 00:14:55,800
你也不能扮演圣诞奶奶
you can't be Mrs. Claus.

365
00:14:56,080 --> 00:14:58,920
但我决定背信弃义  对不起啦  姐们儿
Well, I'm sorry, but I'm throwing you under the sled, sister.

366
00:14:59,900 --> 00:15:01,240
每小时多那两块钱
That extra $2 an hour

367
00:15:01,240 --> 00:15:03,080
能让我们离上等的搅拌器又近一步
will bring us closer to the really good mixer.

368
00:15:03,320 --> 00:15:05,600
依照我生活的态势  这可能是
And the way my life is going, this might be my only chance

369
00:15:05,600 --> 00:15:06,640
我嫁给有钱人的唯一机会
to be married to a rich guy.

370
00:15:10,100 --> 00:15:12,240
如果我是你  我会再三检查这身衣服
I'd double-check those tights if I were you.

371
00:15:23,107 --> 00:15:23,680
这紧身衣太恶心了
These tights suck.

372
00:15:25,980 --> 00:15:27,580
你好呀  小精灵
Hi. Hi, elf.

373
00:15:27,840 --> 00:15:29,940
我刚被分配来前线陪你
I just got assigned to the front of the line with you.

374
00:15:30,140 --> 00:15:30,900
我靠
Oh, crap.

375
00:15:31,660 --> 00:15:33,340
是我呀  玛丽
It's me, Mary.

376
00:15:34,656 --> 00:15:35,341
"圣诞玛丽"
"Mary Christmas."

377
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:38,500
-我哥哥派翠克总这么说  -你说过了
- You know, like my brother Patrick always says. - Yeah, you said that.

378
00:15:39,200 --> 00:15:42,020
我们看上去真有爱  叮铛作响
Look at how cute we look...Jingles!

379
00:15:42,220 --> 00:15:43,640
我刚帮你取了个名字叫"小叮铛"
I just named you Jingles.

380
00:15:44,640 --> 00:15:46,800
懂吗  因为你身上的铃铛
Get it? 'Cause of all your bells.

381
00:15:47,360 --> 00:15:48,200
听着
Oh, listen...

382
00:15:49,100 --> 00:15:52,000
这是我最喜欢的圣诞歌
Ah, this is my number-one favorite Christmas song.

383
00:15:53,140 --> 00:15:54,420
你最喜欢的圣诞歌是什么
What's your favorite Christmas song?

384
00:15:54,560 --> 00:15:57,060
《平安夜[寂静夜]》  懂吗  因为我想你闭嘴
Silent night. Get it? 'Cause I want you to be silent.

385
00:15:58,220 --> 00:15:59,480
你怎么了
What's the matter with you?

386
00:16:00,460 --> 00:16:01,880
你就像个精灵混蛋
You're acting like an elfhole.

387
00:16:04,560 --> 00:16:06,480
你们好  孩子们
Oh, hello, children!

388
00:16:07,200 --> 00:16:09,300
下一个轮到谁去见我丈夫  圣诞老人
Who's next to see my husband, Santa?

389
00:16:09,400 --> 00:16:11,300
我现在很气你
I am so mad at you right now.

390
00:16:13,900 --> 00:16:14,980
等一下  孩子们
Uh, hold on, children.

391
00:16:15,180 --> 00:16:17,040
圣诞老婆婆跟精灵员工之间
Mrs. Claus is just having an issue

392
00:16:17,040 --> 00:16:18,580
出了点小问题
with one of her elf employees.

393
00:16:19,000 --> 00:16:20,640
你这是干嘛  你怎么了
What are you doing? What's wrong with you?

394
00:16:20,740 --> 00:16:22,060
感恩节我爸抛弃我
You abandon me on Christmas

395
00:16:22,060 --> 00:16:24,380
隔天你就在圣诞节抛弃我
the day after my father abandons me on Thanksgiving?

396
00:16:24,700 --> 00:16:25,860
你胆子挺大啊
You have balls.

397
00:16:26,540 --> 00:16:27,660
圣诞树挂球
Christmas balls...

398
00:16:28,020 --> 00:16:29,800
就是圣诞树上挂的
Like on Santa's tree...

399
00:16:30,340 --> 00:16:31,640
或光明节树
Or a Hanukkah bush.

400
00:16:32,800 --> 00:16:34,680
各有各的烦心事  好吗
Look, I've got my own problems, okay?

401
00:16:34,800 --> 00:16:35,940
圣诞老人有点毛手毛脚的
Santa is kind of hands-y.

402
00:16:37,040 --> 00:16:39,580
当我开始从九小时鸡血澎湃的状态下
And you leave me here with this one

403
00:16:39,580 --> 00:16:41,040
开始走下坡时
when I'm coming down the bad side

404
00:16:41,040 --> 00:16:42,380
你居然扔下我  独自忍受那女的
of nine-hour energy mountain?

405
00:16:42,680 --> 00:16:44,220
我不知道坡底会是什么  不过
I don't know what's at the bottom, but so far,

406
00:16:44,220 --> 00:16:46,480
应该不会是我盼望的《34街奇迹》
not the miracle on 34th Street I was hoping for.

407
00:16:47,160 --> 00:16:48,600
-听着  精灵  -她叫小叮铛
- Well, elf-- - Her name is Jingles.

408
00:16:48,700 --> 00:16:50,140
别逼我出手  玛丽  你再放个屁试试
One more word, Mary, seriously.

409
00:16:53,220 --> 00:16:54,720
听着  躁郁特快
Listen, Bipolar Express,

410
00:16:55,820 --> 00:16:57,560
你得一路铃儿响叮当地爬回坡上
you need to jingle all the way up that mountain,

411
00:16:57,560 --> 00:16:59,560
因为所有的孩子在看着咱俩呢
because all these kids are looking at us.

412
00:17:01,200 --> 00:17:01,640
你们好呀
Hello!

413
00:17:02,940 --> 00:17:06,020
-给圣诞老人的愿望清单写好了吗  -嗯  写好了
- You got your list for Santa? - Yep. Got it right here.

414
00:17:06,240 --> 00:17:08,040
他在等着你  快进去吧
Well, he's waiting for you, so go right ahead in.

415
00:17:08,560 --> 00:17:10,960
-好耶  咱们走  -你好
- Yay, let's go! - Hi.

416
00:17:11,180 --> 00:17:13,400
你真漂亮  帽子和大衣真配你
Oh, you look so pretty in your hat and your coat.

417
00:17:13,680 --> 00:17:14,640
多谢夸奖
Thank you very much.

418
00:17:14,840 --> 00:17:16,640
我也有过像这样的大衣
I used to have a coat like that.

419
00:17:16,960 --> 00:17:20,800
但她送给驯鹿了  因为不忍心看它受冷
But she gave it to a reindeer because he was very cold.

420
00:17:21,780 --> 00:17:23,360
给圣诞老人的愿望清单都写好啦
Oh, you have your list for Santa?

421
00:17:23,620 --> 00:17:24,700
看看你都想要什么
Let's see what you want.

422
00:17:25,020 --> 00:17:27,320
-漂亮的洋娃娃  -有过
- Ooh, a pretty doll... - Had it.

423
00:17:27,680 --> 00:17:29,760
-儿童简易烤箱  -有过
- An easy-bake oven... - Had it.

424
00:17:30,140 --> 00:17:32,440
-芭比娃娃的美梦洋房  -也有过
- A Barbie dream house. - Oh, had that, too.

425
00:17:32,540 --> 00:17:35,100
这些我全拥有过  现在却一无所有
Had all those things, and now I have nothing--

426
00:17:35,420 --> 00:17:37,520
-没东西来塞我的大洞  -好了
- nothing to stick in my big hole. - Okay.

427
00:17:38,840 --> 00:17:41,680
-小叮铛  你这是干嘛  -告诉他们  麦克斯
- Jingles, what are you doing? - Tell them, Max.

428
00:17:41,800 --> 00:17:44,740
不不  我不是麦克斯  我是圣诞老奶奶
No, no. I'm not Max. I'm Mrs. Claus--

429
00:17:45,460 --> 00:17:47,920
碧昂丝版的圣诞老奶奶
Mrs. Beyonce Claus--

430
00:17:48,380 --> 00:17:50,220
圣诞老人是我的丈夫
and I'm married to Santa.

431
00:17:50,780 --> 00:17:52,940
不  把你跟我说的告诉他们
No, tell them what you told me--

432
00:17:52,940 --> 00:17:55,600
节日不过是通过买礼物来填满心中的大洞
that it's all just stuff we buy to stick in our big holes.

433
00:17:56,180 --> 00:17:58,480
我们结婚五十年了
I've been married for 50 years.

434
00:17:58,480 --> 00:18:00,240
现在再也不想"洞"这档子事了
I don't even think about holes anymore.

435
00:18:01,040 --> 00:18:03,060
她为什么在跟孩子们说"洞"事
Why is she talking to children about holes?

436
00:18:03,460 --> 00:18:04,460
-我来摆平  -好吧
- I'll get her. - Okay.

437
00:18:06,300 --> 00:18:08,080
-卡洛琳  -不  麦斯克  你说得对
- Caroline-- - No, Max, you were right.

438
00:18:08,080 --> 00:18:09,440
他们应该知道真相
They should know the truth.

439
00:18:09,700 --> 00:18:11,980
圣诞老奶奶  管好你的精灵
Mrs. Claus, have a little, uh, elf control.

440
00:18:13,280 --> 00:18:15,060
小叮铛  我们进屋说
Jingles, come into my little house.

441
00:18:15,180 --> 00:18:17,260
不  麦克斯  他们应该知道的
No, Max. They should know.

442
00:18:17,500 --> 00:18:19,740
34街根本没有奇迹
There is no miracle on 34th Street,

443
00:18:19,740 --> 00:18:21,560
生活一点儿也不美好
and it's not such a wonderful life.

444
00:18:21,780 --> 00:18:23,460
如果生活美好  我就不会穿着开裆裤
If it were, I wouldn't be standing here

445
00:18:23,460 --> 00:18:25,000
站在圣诞乐园的正中间
in crotchless tights in the middle of Santaland,

446
00:18:25,500 --> 00:18:28,220
爸爸也不会坐牢  也不会连搅拌器都买不起
with a father in prison, too broke to buy a mixer.

447
00:18:28,360 --> 00:18:29,920
闭嘴  你会毁掉圣诞节的
Stop it, you're gonna ruin Christmas.

448
00:18:30,140 --> 00:18:31,880
圣诞节就是用钱堆砌起来的
Christmas is all about money.

449
00:18:32,020 --> 00:18:34,060
如果你想收到圣诞老人的礼物  你就得掏腰包
If you want stuff from Santa, you got to buy it,

450
00:18:34,060 --> 00:18:34,960
因为这世上根本没有...
because there is no--

451
00:18:42,020 --> 00:18:43,280
圣诞快乐
Merry Christmas!

452
00:18:46,280 --> 00:18:48,360
快把她带走
Get her out of here now.

453
00:18:48,520 --> 00:18:50,860
还有你  把双腿给我并上
And you, put your knees together!

454
00:18:54,920 --> 00:18:57,000
希望我没有毁掉
I hope I didn't ruin Christmas

455
00:18:57,000 --> 00:18:59,720
-那些小朋友的圣诞节  -不  你没有
- for all those sweet children. - No, you didn't.

456
00:18:59,860 --> 00:19:02,420
他们看见的不过是个穿开裆裤的抓狂精灵
All they saw was a crotchless elf freaking out.

457
00:19:02,580 --> 00:19:05,980
但"圣诞玛丽"估计一辈子都好不了了
But "Mary Christmas" will never recover.

458
00:19:07,320 --> 00:19:09,860
两周内  他们会发现她在公寓
They'll find her in her studio apartment in two weeks

459
00:19:10,060 --> 00:19:11,580
慎重地吊死在烟囱上
hung from the chimney with care.

460
00:19:12,700 --> 00:19:14,320
这都怪你
Well, this is all kind of your fault.

461
00:19:14,380 --> 00:19:15,940
是你让我弃明投暗的
You told me to come to the dark side.

462
00:19:16,200 --> 00:19:18,100
我只是让你正视自己的感觉
I just told you to get in touch with your feelings.

463
00:19:18,220 --> 00:19:20,080
我可没想到你会变身成"黑洛林"
I didn't think you'd turn into Darth Caroline.

464
00:19:20,700 --> 00:19:22,560
一旦黑化  就难以回头嘛
Once I went there, I couldn't get back.

465
00:19:23,060 --> 00:19:25,080
是啊  狂喝精灵果汁"没有"推波助澜
Yeah, and chugging that elf juice didn't help.

466
00:19:25,520 --> 00:19:26,720
不只是那饮料
It wasn't just the drink.

467
00:19:26,840 --> 00:19:28,720
在那些礼物让我崩溃前
Before those presents came crashing down on me,

468
00:19:28,720 --> 00:19:29,540
现实早把我击垮了
reality did.

469
00:19:29,780 --> 00:19:31,880
我身无分文  我那个坐牢的爸爸
I have no money and a father in prison

470
00:19:31,880 --> 00:19:33,560
不愿意在感恩节见我
who didn't even want to see me on Thanksgiving.

471
00:19:34,240 --> 00:19:36,820
是啊  这世上还有很多比你更惨的人
Yeah, well, there are a lot of people way worse off than you.

472
00:19:36,820 --> 00:19:38,440
没错  你爸是在坐牢
Yes, your father's in prison,

473
00:19:38,440 --> 00:19:40,680
但至少你有爸爸  还知道他在哪儿
but at least you have one and you know where he is.

474
00:19:41,200 --> 00:19:43,560
你有一个家  有一份工作
And you have a home and a job.

475
00:19:43,560 --> 00:19:45,500
你还他娘的有匹马
And you have a freaking horse.

476
00:19:50,000 --> 00:19:50,520
所以...
So...

477
00:19:50,520 --> 00:19:53,280
节日快乐  生活的确很美好
Happy holidays. It is a wonderful life.

478
00:19:54,100 --> 00:19:56,440
你说得对  我很幸运
You're right. I am so lucky.

479
00:19:57,540 --> 00:20:00,320
既然现在咱俩很可能
Well, since right now is the closest to the Christmas spirit

480
00:20:00,400 --> 00:20:01,500
是最有节日精神的时刻
we're probably gonna get,

481
00:20:01,780 --> 00:20:04,260
圣诞老人托我把你的圣诞礼物给你
Santa wanted me to give you your Christmas present now.

482
00:20:05,260 --> 00:20:06,600
我们的新搅拌器
It's our new mixer.

483
00:20:07,160 --> 00:20:08,640
我们得用传统方法了
We're gonna old-school it.

484
00:20:10,040 --> 00:20:11,960
你送我个勺子[爱抚]
Aw, you spooned me.

485
00:20:13,440 --> 00:20:15,380
我觉得惭愧  没给你准备礼物
I feel bad. I didn't get you anything.

486
00:20:15,920 --> 00:20:18,040
麦克斯  你给了我一切
Max, you got me everything.

487
00:20:18,880 --> 00:20:21,120
遇到你之前  我只能住在地铁里  你看现在...
Before you, I was living on a subway, and now look...

488
00:20:21,360 --> 00:20:22,640
我住在地铁附近
I'm living near a subway.

489
00:20:24,040 --> 00:20:25,140
是你买的吗
So did you buy this?

490
00:20:25,660 --> 00:20:26,800
不  圣诞老人送的
No, it's from Santa.

491
00:20:28,800 --> 00:20:30,240
小叮铛  是你偷的吗
Jingles, did you steal this?

492
00:20:31,420 --> 00:20:31,960
是
Yeah.

493
00:20:32,840 --> 00:20:34,960
在他们扔咱们出去时  我趁乱拿的
I grabbed it when they were throwing us out.

494
00:20:35,720 --> 00:20:36,518
卡洛琳·钱宁
Wow, Caroline Channing.

495
00:20:36,780 --> 00:20:38,580
继续努力的话  想去监狱看你爸
You keep this up, and you won't have to ask permission

496
00:20:38,580 --> 00:20:39,940
就再不用经过批准了
to visit your father in prison.

497
00:20:40,480 --> 00:20:43,140
但我有从蛋糕基金里拿出两块钱
But I did give $2 of our cupcake-fund money

498
00:20:43,140 --> 00:20:44,460
给救世军的圣诞老人
